␀␀␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀N␀␀␀_␀␀␀m␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀*␀␀␀H␀␀␀i␀␀␀,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀'␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀L␀␀␀/␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀l␀␀␀␀␀␀␀[␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀)␀␀␀B␀␀␀$␀␀␀I␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀7␀␀␀g␀␀␀8␀␀␀M␀␀␀1␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀k␀␀␀␀␀␀␀O␀␀␀␀␀␀␀#␀␀␀.␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀␀␀=␀␀␀Y␀␀␀]␀␀␀␀␀␀␀>␀␀␀␀␀␀d␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀K␀␀␀␀␀␀␀<␀␀␀9␀␀␀␀␀␀T␀␀␀h␀␀␀C␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀\␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;␀␀␀^␀␀␀X␀␀␀6␀␀␀A␀␀␀E␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀a␀␀␀R␀␀␀␀␀␀D␀␀␀␀STR_AB_ADDRESSBOOK_NOT_FOUNDNo $1$ exists.␀STR_CANNOT_CONVERT_STRINGThe string “$string$” cannot be converted using the encoding “$charset$”.␀STR_CANNOT_OPEN_BOOKCannot open Evolution address book.␀STR_COLUMN_NOT_ADDABLEThe column “$columnname$” could not be added. Maybe the file system is write-protected.␀STR_COLUMN_NOT_ALTERABLEThe column “$columnname$” could not be altered. Maybe the file system is write-protected.␀STR_COLUMN_NOT_DROPThe column at position “$position$” could not be dropped. Maybe the file system is write-protected.␀STR_COULD_NOT_ALTER_TABLEThe table could not be altered.␀STR_COULD_NOT_CREATE_INDEXThe index could not be created. An unknown error appeared.␀STR_COULD_NOT_CREATE_INDEX_KEYSIZEThe index could not be created. The size of the chosen column is too big.␀STR_COULD_NOT_CREATE_INDEX_NAMEThe index could not be created. The file “$filename$” is used by another index.␀STR_COULD_NOT_CREATE_INDEX_NOT_UNIQUEThe index could not be created. The values are not unique.␀STR_COULD_NOT_DELETE_FILEThe file $filename$ could not be deleted.␀STR_COULD_NOT_DELETE_INDEXThe index could not be deleted. An unknown error while accessing the file system occurred.␀STR_COULD_NOT_LOAD_FILEThe file $filename$ could not be loaded.␀STR_DATA_CANNOT_SELECT_UNFILTEREDUnable to display the complete table content. Please apply a filter.␀STR_DB_INVALID_SQL_NAME$1$ is no SQL conform identifier.␀STR_DB_NOT_CONNECTEDNo connection to the database exists.␀STR_DB_OBJECT_NAME_IS_USEDThe name “$1$” is already in use in the database.␀STR_DB_OBJECT_NAME_WITH_SLASHESThe name must not contain any slashes (“/”).␀STR_DB_QUERY_NAME_WITH_QUOTESQuery names must not contain quote characters.␀STR_DELETE_ROWThe row could not be deleted. The option “Display inactive records” is set.␀STR_DUPLICATE_VALUE_IN_COLUMNDuplicate value found in column “$columnname$”.␀STR_ERRORMSG_SEQUENCEFunction sequence error.␀STR_ERROR_NEW_VERSIONThe connection could not be established. The database was created by a newer version of %PRODUCTNAME.␀STR_FORMULA_WRONGThe formula for TypeInfoSettings is wrong!␀STR_INVALID_BOOKMARKInvalid bookmark value␀STR_INVALID_COLUMNNAMEThe column name “$columnname$” is not valid.␀STR_INVALID_COLUMN_DECIMAL_VALUEThe “$columnname$” column has been defined as a “Decimal” type, the maximum length is $precision$ characters (with $scale$ decimal places).

The specified value “$value$” is longer than the number of digits allowed.␀STR_INVALID_COLUMN_DESCRIPTOR_ERRORCould not append column: invalid column descriptor.␀STR_INVALID_COLUMN_NAME_LENGTHInvalid column name length for column “$columnname$”.␀STR_INVALID_COLUMN_PRECISIONInvalid precision for column “$columnname$”.␀STR_INVALID_COLUMN_SELECTIONThe statement contains an invalid selection of columns.␀STR_INVALID_COLUMN_TYPEInvalid column type for column “$columnname$”.␀STR_INVALID_COLUMN_VALUEThe column “$columnname$” could not be updated. The value is invalid for that column.␀STR_INVALID_DBASE_FILEThe file “$filename$” is an invalid (or unrecognized) dBASE file.␀STR_INVALID_FILE_URLThe given URL contains no valid local file system path. Please check the location of your database file.␀STR_INVALID_GROUP_DESCRIPTOR_ERRORCould not create group: invalid object descriptor.␀STR_INVALID_INDEXInvalid descriptor index.␀STR_INVALID_INDEX_DESCRIPTOR_ERRORCould not create index: invalid object descriptor.␀STR_INVALID_KEY_DESCRIPTOR_ERRORCould not create key: invalid object descriptor.␀STR_INVALID_PARA_COUNTThe count of the given parameter values does not match the parameters.␀STR_INVALID_PRECISION_SCALEPrecision is less than scale for column “$columnname$”.␀STR_INVALID_TABLE_DESCRIPTOR_ERRORCould not create table: invalid object descriptor.␀STR_INVALID_USER_DESCRIPTOR_ERRORCould not create user: invalid object descriptor.␀STR_INVALID_VIEW_DESCRIPTOR_ERRORCould not create view: invalid object descriptor.␀STR_LOAD_FILE_ERROR_MESSAGEThe attempt to load the file resulted in the following error message ($exception_type$):

$error_message$␀STR_NO_CLASSNAMEThe driver class “$classname$” could not be loaded.␀STR_NO_CLASSNAME_PATHThe additional driver class path is “$classpath$”.␀STR_NO_CONNECTIONThe connection could not be created. Maybe the necessary data provider is not installed.␀STR_NO_CONNECTION_GIVENNo connection to the database exists.␀STR_NO_DOCUMENTUIThe provided DocumentUI is not allowed to be NULL.␀STR_NO_ELEMENT_NAMEThere is no element named “$name$”.␀STR_NO_INPUTSTREAMThe input stream was not set.␀STR_NO_JAVANo Java installation could be found. Please check your installation.␀STR_NO_MAC_OS_FOUNDNo suitable macOS installation was found.␀STR_NO_RESULTSETThe execution of the query does not return a valid result set.␀STR_NO_ROWCOUNTThe execution of the update statement does not affect any rows.␀STR_NO_STORAGEThe connection can not be established. No storage or URL was given.␀STR_NO_TABLENo such table!␀STR_NO_TABLENAMEThere is no table named “$tablename$”.␀STR_NO_TABLE_CONTAINERAn error occurred while obtaining the connection’s table container.␀STR_NO_VALID_FILE_URLThe URL “$URL$” is not valid. A connection cannot be created.␀STR_ONL_ONE_COLUMN_PER_INDEXThe index could not be created. Only one column per index is allowed.␀STR_OPERATOR_TOO_COMPLEXThe query cannot be executed. The operator is too complex.␀STR_PARA_ONLY_PREPAREDParameters can appear only in prepared statements.␀STR_PARSER_CYCLIC_SUB_QUERIESThe statement contains a cyclic reference to one or more subqueries.␀STR_PRIVILEGE_NOT_GRANTEDPrivilege not granted: Only table privileges can be granted.␀STR_PRIVILEGE_NOT_REVOKEDPrivilege not revoked: Only table privileges can be revoked.␀STR_QUERY_COMPLEX_COUNTThe query cannot be executed. It is too complex. Only “COUNT(*)” is supported.␀STR_QUERY_FUNCTION_NOT_SUPPORTEDThe query cannot be executed. The function is not supported.␀STR_QUERY_INVALID_BETWEENThe query cannot be executed. The “BETWEEN” arguments are not correct.␀STR_QUERY_INVALID_LIKE_COLUMNThe query cannot be executed. You cannot use “LIKE” with columns of this type.␀STR_QUERY_INVALID_LIKE_STRINGThe query cannot be executed. “LIKE” can be used with a string argument only.␀STR_QUERY_LIKE_WILDCARDThe query cannot be executed. The “LIKE” condition contains wildcard in the middle.␀STR_QUERY_LIKE_WILDCARD_MANYThe query cannot be executed. The “LIKE” condition contains too many wildcards.␀STR_QUERY_MORE_TABLESThe query cannot be executed. It contains more than one table.␀STR_QUERY_NOT_LIKE_TOO_COMPLEXThe query cannot be executed. The “NOT LIKE” condition is too complex.␀STR_QUERY_NO_COLUMNThe query cannot be executed. It contains no valid columns.␀STR_QUERY_NO_TABLEThe query cannot be executed. It contains no valid table.␀STR_QUERY_TOO_COMPLEXThe query cannot be executed. It is too complex.␀STR_ROW_ALREADY_DELETEDThe row could not be deleted. It is already deleted.␀STR_ROW_SET_OPERATION_VETOEDThe record operation has been vetoed.␀STR_SORT_BY_COL_ONLYCan only sort by table columns.␀STR_SQL_NAME_ERRORThe name “$name$” does not match SQL naming constraints.␀STR_STRING_LENGTH_EXCEEDEDThe string “$string$” exceeds the maximum length of $maxlen$ characters when converted to the target character set “$charset$”.␀STR_TABLE_NOT_DROPThe table “$tablename$” could not be dropped. Maybe the file system is write-protected.␀STR_TABLE_READONLYThe table cannot be changed. It is read only.␀STR_TYPE_NOT_CONVERTThe type could not be converted.␀STR_UNKNOWN_COLUMN_TYPEThe type of column at position “$position$” is unknown.␀STR_UNKNOWN_PARA_TYPEThe type of parameter at position “$position$” is unknown.␀STR_UNSUPPORTED_FEATUREThe driver does not support the functionality for “$featurename$”. It is not implemented.␀STR_UNSUPPORTED_FUNCTIONThe driver does not support the function “$functionname$”.␀STR_URI_SYNTAX_ERRORThe connection URL is invalid.␀STR_VIEW_NO_COMMAND_ERRORCould not create view: no command object.␀STR_WRONG_PARAM_INDEXYou tried to set a parameter at position “$pos$” but there is/are only “$count$” parameter(s) allowed. One reason may be that the property “ParameterNameSubstitution” is not set to TRUE in the data source.␀stock_Add␀stock_Apply␀stock_Cancel␀stock_Close␀stock_Delete␀stock_Edit␀stock_Help␀stock_New␀stock_No␀stock_OK␀stock_Remove␀stock_Reset␀stock_Yes␀Project-Id-Version: PACKAGE VERSION
