Updating of shared extension requires administrator privileges. Contact your system administrator to update the following shared extensions:␀RID_STR_NO_SUCH_PACKAGEThere is no such extension deployed: ␀RID_STR_PACKAGE_ALREADY_ADDEDExtension has already been added: ␀RID_STR_PACKAGE_BUNDLEAll supported files␀RID_STR_PACKAGE_BUNDLEExtension␀RID_STR_PYTHON_COMPONENTUNO Python Component␀RID_STR_RDB_TYPELIBUNO RDB Type Library␀RID_STR_REGISTERING_PACKAGEEnabling: ␀RID_STR_REMOVING_PACKAGESRemoving %EXTENSION_NAME␀RID_STR_REVOKING_PACKAGEDisabling: ␀RID_STR_SFWK_LIB%MACROLANG Library␀RID_STR_SHOW_LICENSE_CMDShow license␀RID_STR_SYNCHRONIZING_REPOSITORYSynchronizing repository for %NAME extensions␀RID_STR_UNOPKG_ACCEPT_LIC_1Extension Software License Agreement of $NAME:␀RID_STR_UNOPKG_ACCEPT_LIC_2Read the complete License Agreement displayed above. Accept the License Agreement by typing "yes" on the console then press the Return key. Type "no" to decline and to abort the extension setup.␀RID_STR_UNOPKG_ACCEPT_LIC_3[Enter "yes" or "no"]:␀RID_STR_UNOPKG_ACCEPT_LIC_4Your input was not correct. Please enter "yes" or "no":␀RID_STR_UNOPKG_ACCEPT_LIC_NN␀RID_STR_UNOPKG_ACCEPT_LIC_NONO␀RID_STR_UNOPKG_ACCEPT_LIC_YY␀RID_STR_UNOPKG_ACCEPT_LIC_YESYES␀RID_STR_UNOPKG_ERRORERROR: ␀RID_STR_UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPEThis media-type is not supported: ␀RID_STR_UNSUPPORTED_PLATFORMThe extension '%Name' does not work on this computer.␀RID_STR_WARNINGBOX_VERSION_EQUAL_DIFFERENT_NAMESYou are about to install version $NEW of the extension '$NAME'.
That version, named '$OLDNAME', is already installed.
Click 'OK' to replace the installed extension.
Click 'Cancel' to stop the installation.␀RID_STR_WARNINGBOX_VERSION_GREATER_DIFFERENT_NAMESYou are about to install version $NEW of the extension '$NAME'.
The older version $DEPLOYED, named '$OLDNAME', is already installed.
Click 'OK' to replace the installed extension.
Click 'Cancel' to stop the installation.␀RID_STR_WARNINGBOX_VERSION_LESS_DIFFERENT_NAMESYou are about to install version $NEW of the extension '$NAME'.
The newer version $DEPLOYED, named '$OLDNAME', is already installed.
Click 'OK' to replace the installed extension.
Click 'Cancel' to stop the installation.␀RID_STR_WARNING_DISABLE_SHARED_EXTENSIONMake sure that no further users are working with the same %PRODUCTNAME, when changing shared extensions in a multi user environment.
Click 'OK' to disable the extension.
Click 'Cancel' to stop disabling the extension.␀RID_STR_WARNING_ENABLE_SHARED_EXTENSIONMake sure that no further users are working with the same %PRODUCTNAME, when changing shared extensions in a multi user environment.
Click 'OK' to enable the extension.
Click 'Cancel' to stop enabling the extension.␀RID_STR_WARNING_INSTALL_EXTENSIONYou are about to install the extension '%NAME'.
Click 'OK' to proceed with the installation.
Click 'Cancel' to stop the installation.␀RID_STR_WARNING_INSTALL_EXTENSION_DISABLEDExtension installation is currently disabled. Please consult your system administrator for more information.␀RID_STR_WARNING_REMOVE_EXTENSIONYou are about to remove the extension '%NAME'.
Click 'OK' to remove the extension.
Click 'Cancel' to stop removing the extension.␀RID_STR_WARNING_REMOVE_EXTENSION_DISABLEDExtension removal is currently disabled. Please consult your system administrator for more information.␀RID_STR_WARNING_REMOVE_SHARED_EXTENSIONMake sure that no further users are working with the same %PRODUCTNAME, when changing shared extensions in a multi user environment.
Click 'OK' to remove the extension.
Click 'Cancel' to stop removing the extension.␀RID_STR_WARNING_VERSION_EQUALYou are about to install version $NEW of the extension '$NAME'.
That version is already installed.
Click 'OK' to replace the installed extension.
Click 'Cancel' to stop the installation.␀RID_STR_WARNING_VERSION_GREATERYou are about to install version $NEW of the extension '$NAME'.
The older version $DEPLOYED is already installed.
Click 'OK' to replace the installed extension.
Click 'Cancel' to stop the installation.␀RID_STR_WARNING_VERSION_LESSYou are about to install version $NEW of the extension '$NAME'.
The newer version $DEPLOYED is already installed.
Click 'OK' to replace the installed extension.
Click 'Cancel' to stop the installation.␀STR_ASK_START_SETUP_MANUALLYStart the setup application to repair the installation from the CD or the folder containing the installation packages.␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_2NDOFFICE_WITHCATThere is already another %PRODUCTNAME instance running.  Please close all %PRODUCTNAME processes before running with the '--cat' or '--script-cat' option.␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_CANNOT_STARTThe application cannot be started. ␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_DIR_MISSINGThe configuration directory "$1" could not be found.␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_FILE_CORRUPTThe configuration file "$1" is corrupt.␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_FILE_MISSINGThe configuration file "$1" was not found.␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_INTERNALAn internal error occurred.␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_LANGUAGE_MISSINGThe user interface language cannot be determined.␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_NOACCESSRIGHTS%PRODUCTNAME user installation could not be processed due to missing access rights. Please make sure that you have sufficient access rights for the following location and restart %PRODUCTNAME:

␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_NOTENOUGHDISKSPACE%PRODUCTNAME user installation could not be completed due to insufficient free disk space. Please free more disc space at the following location and restart %PRODUCTNAME:

␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_NO_CFG_SERVICEThe configuration service is not available.␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_NO_PATHSET_SERVICEThe path manager is not available.
␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_NO_SUPPORTThe configuration file "$1" does not support the current version.␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_PATH_INVALIDThe installation path is invalid.␀STR_BOOTSTRAP_ERR_USERINSTALL_FAILEDUser installation could not be completed. ␀STR_CONFIG_ERR_ACCESS_GENERALA general error occurred while accessing your central configuration. ␀STR_ERR_PRINTDISABLEDPrinting is disabled. No documents can be printed.␀STR_LO_MUST_BE_RESTARTED%PRODUCTNAME must unfortunately be manually restarted once after installation or update.␀STR_QUERY_USERDATALOCKEDEither another instance of %PRODUCTNAME is accessing your personal settings or your personal settings are locked.
Simultaneous access can lead to inconsistencies in your personal settings. Before continuing, you should make sure user '$u' closes %PRODUCTNAME on host '$h'.

Do you really want to continue?␀STR_TITLE_USERDATALOCKED%PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION␀dependenciesdialog|DependenciesSystem dependencies check␀dependenciesdialog|label1The extension cannot be installed as the following system dependencies are not fulfilled:␀extensionmanager|ExtensionManagerDialogExtensions␀extensionmanager|addbtn_Add␀extensionmanager|bundledBundled with %PRODUCTNAME␀extensionmanager|enablebtn_Enable␀extensionmanager|extended_tip|ExtensionManagerDialogThe Extension Manager adds, removes, disables, enables, and updates extensions.␀extensionmanager|extended_tip|addbtnClick Add to add an extension.␀extensionmanager|extended_tip|bundledBundled extensions are installed by the system administrator using the operating system specific installer packages. These can not be installed, updated or removed here.␀extensionmanager|extended_tip|extensionsSelect the extension that you want to remove, enable, or disable. For some extensions, you can also open an Options dialog.␀extensionmanager|extended_tip|getextensionsYou can find a collection of extensions on the Web.␀extensionmanager|extended_tip|optionsbtnSelect an installed extension, then click to open the Options dialog for the extension.␀extensionmanager|extended_tip|removebtnSelect the extension that you want to remove, and then click Remove.␀extensionmanager|extended_tip|sharedFilter extensions available for all users of this computer.␀extensionmanager|extended_tip|updatebtnClick to check for online updates of all installed extensions. To check for updates of the selected extension only, choose the Update command from the context menu. The check for availability of updates starts immediately.␀extensionmanager|extended_tip|userFilter extensions only available for the currently logged in user.␀extensionmanager|getextensionsGet more extensions online...␀extensionmanager|label1Display Extensions␀extensionmanager|optionsbtn_Options␀extensionmanager|progressftAdding %EXTENSION_NAME␀extensionmanager|removebtn_Remove␀extensionmanager|searchSearch...␀extensionmanager|sharedInstalled for all users␀extensionmanager|updatebtnCheck for _Updates␀extensionmanager|userInstalled for current user␀installforalldialog|InstallForAllDialogFor whom do you want to install the extension?␀installforalldialog|InstallForAllDialogMake sure that no further users are working with the same %PRODUCTNAME, when installing an extension for all users in a multi user environment.␀installforalldialog|no_For all users␀installforalldialog|yes_Only for me␀licensedialog|LicenseDialogExtension Software License Agreement␀licensedialog|acceptAccept␀licensedialog|declineDecline␀licensedialog|down_Scroll Down␀licensedialog|headPlease follow these steps to proceed with the installation of the extension:␀licensedialog|label21.␀licensedialog|label32.␀licensedialog|label4Read the complete License Agreement. Use the scroll bar or the 'Scroll Down' button in this dialog to view the entire license text.␀licensedialog|label5Accept the License Agreement for the extension by pressing the 'Accept' button.␀showlicensedialog|ShowLicenseDialogExtension Software License Agreement␀showlicensedialog|extended_tip|ShowLicenseDialogRead the license. Click the Scroll Down button to scroll down if necessary. Click Accept to continue the installation of the extension.␀stock_Add␀stock_Apply␀stock_Cancel␀stock_Close␀stock_Delete␀stock_Edit␀stock_Help␀stock_New␀stock_No␀stock_OK␀stock_Remove␀stock_Reset␀stock_Yes␀updatedialog|DESCRIPTION_LABELDescription␀updatedialog|INSTALL_Install␀updatedialog|PUBLISHER_LABELPublisher:␀updatedialog|PUBLISHER_LINKbutton␀updatedialog|RELEASE_NOTES_LABELWhat is new:␀updatedialog|RELEASE_NOTES_LINKRelease notes␀updatedialog|UPDATE_ALL_Show all updates␀updatedialog|UPDATE_CHECKINGChecking...␀updatedialog|UPDATE_LABEL_Available extension updates␀updatedialog|UpdateDialogExtension Update␀updatedialog|extended_tip|DESCRIPTIONSWhile checking for updates, you see a progress indicator. Wait for some messages to show up in the dialog, or click Cancel to abort the update check.␀updatedialog|extended_tip|UPDATE_ALLBy default, only the downloadable extensions are shown in the dialog. Mark Show all Updates to see also other extensions and error messages.␀updatedialog|extended_tip|UpdateDialogClick the Check for Updates button in the Extension Manager to check for online updates for all installed extensions. To check for online updates for only the selected extension, right-click to open the context menu, then choose Update.␀updateinstalldialog|DOWNLOADINGDownloading extensions...␀updateinstalldialog|RESULTSResult␀updateinstalldialog|UpdateInstallDialogDownload and Installation␀updateinstalldialog|extended_tip|UpdateInstallDialogClick the Check for Updates button in the Extensions dialog to check for online updates for all installed extensions. To check for online updates for only the selected extension, right-click to open the context menu, then choose Update.␀updaterequireddialog|UpdateRequiredDialogExtension Update Required␀updaterequireddialog|checkCheck for _Updates...␀updaterequireddialog|disableDisable all␀updaterequireddialog|progresslabelAdding %EXTENSION_NAME␀updaterequireddialog|updatelabel%PRODUCTNAME has been updated to a new version. Some installed %PRODUCTNAME extensions are not compatible with this version and need to be updated before they can be used.␀Project-Id-Version: PACKAGE VERSION
