ced by the deleted cells with the cells underneath it.␀deletecells|label1Selection␀deletecells|leftShift cells _left␀deletecells|rowsDelete entire _row(s)␀deletecells|upShift cells _up␀deletecolumnentry/colsCols(; Separated)␀deletecolumnentry|deleteDelete␀deletecolumnentry|nameDelete Columns␀deletecontents|DeleteContentsDialogDelete Contents␀deletecontents|comments_Comments␀deletecontents|datetime_Date & time␀deletecontents|deleteallDelete _all␀deletecontents|extended_tip|DeleteContentsDialogSpecifies the contents to be deleted from the active cell or from a selected cell range.␀deletecontents|extended_tip|commentsDeletes comments added to cells. All other elements remain unchanged.␀deletecontents|extended_tip|datetimeDeletes date and time values. Formats, text, numbers and formulas remain unchanged.␀deletecontents|extended_tip|deleteallDeletes all content from the selected cell range.␀deletecontents|extended_tip|formatsDeletes format attributes applied to cells. All cell content remains unchanged.␀deletecontents|extended_tip|formulasDeletes formulas. Text, numbers, formats, dates and times remain unchanged.␀deletecontents|extended_tip|numbersDeletes numbers only. Formats and formulas remain unchanged.␀deletecontents|extended_tip|objectsDeletes objects. All cell content remains unchanged.␀deletecontents|extended_tip|textDeletes text only. Formats, formulas, numbers and dates are not affected.␀deletecontents|formatsFor_mats␀deletecontents|formulas_Formulas␀deletecontents|label2Selection␀deletecontents|numbers_Numbers␀deletecontents|objects_Objects␀deletecontents|text_Text␀deleterow|columnColumn␀deleterow|delete_btnDelete␀deleterow|delete_labelDelete Row Action␀deleterow|valueEnter Value␀descriptivestatisticsdialog|DescriptiveStatisticsDialogDescriptive Statistics␀descriptivestatisticsdialog|extended_tip|DescriptiveStatisticsDialogFill a table in the spreadsheet with the main statistical properties of the data set.␀descriptivestatistics