hDialogOptimal Column Width␀optimalcolwidthdialog|default_Default value␀optimalcolwidthdialog|extended_tip|OptimalColWidthDialogDefines the optimal column width for selected columns.␀optimalcolwidthdialog|extended_tip|defaultDefines the optimal column width in order to display the entire contents of the column.␀optimalcolwidthdialog|extended_tip|valueDefines additional spacing between the longest entry in a column and the vertical column borders.␀optimalcolwidthdialog|label1Add:␀optimalrowheightdialog|OptimalRowHeightDialogOptimal Row Height␀optimalrowheightdialog|default_Default value␀optimalrowheightdialog|extended_tip|OptimalRowHeightDialogDetermines the optimal row height for the selected rows.␀optimalrowheightdialog|extended_tip|defaultRestores the default value for the optimal row height.␀optimalrowheightdialog|extended_tip|valueSets additional spacing between the largest character in a row and the cell boundaries.␀optimalrowheightdialog|label1Add:␀optsortlists|add_Add␀optsortlists|copy_Copy␀optsortlists|copyfromlabelCopy list _from:␀optsortlists|delete_Delete␀optsortlists|discard_Discard␀optsortlists|entrieslabel_Entries␀optsortlists|extended_tip|deleteDeletes the selected element or elements without requiring confirmation.␀optsortlists|listslabel_Lists␀optsortlists|modifyModif_y␀optsortlists|new_New␀pagetemplatedialog|PageTemplateDialogPage Style␀pagetemplatedialog|backgroundBackground␀pagetemplatedialog|bordersBorders␀pagetemplatedialog|footerFooter␀pagetemplatedialog|headerHeader␀pagetemplatedialog|organizerOrganizer␀pagetemplatedialog|pagePage␀pagetemplatedialog|sheetSheet␀paradialog|ParagraphDialogParagraph␀paradialog|labelTP_PARA_ALIGNAlignment␀paradialog|labelTP_PARA_ASIANAsian Typography␀paradialog|labelTP_PARA_STDIndents & Spacing␀paradialog|labelTP_TABULATORTabs␀paratemplatedialog|ParaTemplateDialogCell Style␀paratemplatedialog|alignmentAlignment␀paratemplatedialog|asiantypoAsian Typography␀paratemplatedialog|backgroundBackground␀paratemplatedialog|bordersBorders␀paratemplatedialog|fontFont␀paratemplatedialog|fonteffectsFont Effects␀paratemplatedialog|numbersNumbers␀paratemplatedialog|organizerOrganizer␀paratemplatedialog|protectionCell Protection␀pastespecial|OptionsFrameOptions␀pastespecial|PasteSpecialPaste Special␀pastespecial|addAdd␀pastespecial|cbImmediatelyRun immediately␀pastespecial|commentsComments␀pastespecial|datetimeDate & time␀pastespecial|divideDivide␀pastespecial|extended_tip|PasteSpecialInserts the contents of the clipboard into the current document in a format that you can specify.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|addAdds the values in the clipboard cells to the values in the target cells. Also, if the clipboard only contains comments, adds the comments to the target cells.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|cbImmediatelyCheck this option to run the preset immediately. Uncheck it to manipulate the options before clicking OK.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|commentsInserts comments that are attached to cells. If you want to add the comments to the existing cell content, select the "Add" operation.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|datetimeInserts cells containing date and time values.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|divideDivides the values in the target cells by the values in the clipboard cells.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|formatsInserts cell format attributes.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|formulasInserts cells containing formulae.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|linkInserts the cell range as a link, so that changes made to the cells in the source file are updated in the target file. To ensure that changes made to empty cells in the source file are updated in the target file, ensure that the "Paste All" option is also selected.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|move_downTarget cells are shifted downward when you insert cells from the clipboard.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|move_rightTarget cells are shifted to the right when you insert cells from the clipboard.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|multiplyMultiplies the values in the clipboard cells with the values in the target cells.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|no_shiftInserted cells replace the target cells.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|noneDoes not apply an operation when you insert the cell range from the clipboard. The contents of the clipboard will replace existing cell contents.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|numbersInserts cells containing numbers.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|objectsInserts objects contained within the selected cell range. These can be OLE objects, chart objects, or drawing objects.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|paste_allPastes all cell contents, comments, formats, and objects into the current document.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|paste_formatsPastes only the formats from the source range without changing the values in the destination range.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|paste_transposePastes cell contents transposed, hence columns are converted to rows.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|paste_values_formatsPastes cell values, formula results and formats applied to cells.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|paste_values_onlyPastes numbers, text, dates and the results of formulas.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|skip_emptyEmpty cells from the clipboard do not replace target cells. If you use this option in conjunction with the "Multiply" or the "Divide" operation, the operation is not applied to the target cell of an empty cell in the clipboard.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|subtractSubtracts the values in the clipboard cells from the values in the target cells.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|textInserts cells containing text.␀pastespecial|extended_tip|transposeThe rows of the range in the clipboard are pasted to become columns of the output range. The columns of the range in the clipboard are pasted to become rows.␀pastespecial|formatsFormats␀pastespecial|formulasFormulas␀pastespecial|frPresetsPresets␀pastespecial|label1Paste␀pastespecial|label2Operations␀pastespecial|label4Shift Cells␀pastespecial|linkAs Link␀paste