pression for the export. A high compression means a smaller, but slower to load image.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|compresslzwLZW compression is the compression of a file into a smaller file using a table-based lookup algorithm.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|compressnoneSpecifies that you do not wish to use compression.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|epsipreviewcbSpecifies whether a monochrome preview graphic in EPSI format is exported together with the PostScript file. This format only contains printable characters from the 7-bit ASCII code.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|heightmfSpecifies the height.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|interlacedcbSpecifies whether the graphic is to be saved in interlaced mode.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|level1rbCompression is not available at this level. Select the Level 1 option if your PostScript printer does not offer the capabilities of Level 2.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|level2rbSelect the Level 2 option if your output device supports colored bitmaps, palette graphics and compressed graphics.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|losslesscbLossless images do not lose quality but result in larger files.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|resolutionlbEnter the image resolution. Select the measurement units from the list box.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|resolutionmfEnter the image resolution. Select the measurement units from the list box.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|rlecbApplies RLE (Run Length Encoding) to the BMP graphics.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|savetransparencycbSpecifies whether to save the background of the picture as transparent. Only objects will be visible in the GIF image. Use the Color Replacer to set the transparent color in the picture.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|textcbExports the file in ASCII text format. The resulting file is larger than a binary file.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|tiffpreviewcbSpecifies whether a preview image is exported in the TIFF format together with the actual PostScript file.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|widthlbSpecifies the width.␀graphicexport|extended_tip|widthmfSpecifies the measurement units.␀graphicexport|interlacedcbInterlaced␀graphicexport|labeDrawing Objects␀graphicexport|labelCompression␀graphicexport|label1Size␀graphicexport|label12Mode␀graphicexport|label16Encoding␀graphicexport|label17Preview␀graphicexport|label18Color Format␀graphicexport|label19Version␀graphicexport|label2Color Depth␀graphicexport|label20Compression␀graphicexport|label3Compression␀graphicexport|label4Information␀graphicexport|label5Width:␀graphicexport|label6Height:␀graphicexport|label9Quality␀graphicexport|level1rbLevel 1␀graphicexport|level2rbLevel 2␀graphicexport|liststore1pixels/cm␀graphicexport|liststore1pixels/inch␀graphicexport|liststore1pixels/meter␀graphicexport|liststore2cm␀graphicexport|liststore2inches␀graphicexport|liststore2mm␀graphicexport|liststore2pixels␀graphicexport|liststore2points␀graphicexport|losslesscbLossless␀graphicexport|modifydimensionscbModify dimensions␀graphicexport|modifyresolutioncbModify resolution␀graphicexport|resolutionftResolution:␀graphicexport|rlecbRLE encoding␀graphicexport|savetransparencycbSave transparency␀graphicexport|textcbText␀graphicexport|tiffpreviewcbImage preview (TIFF)␀javadisableddialog|JavaDisabledDialog%PRODUCTNAME requires a Java runtime environment (JRE) to perform this task. However, use of a JRE has been disabled. Do you want to enable the use of a JRE now?␀javadisableddialog|JavaDisabledDialogEnable JRE?␀linewindow|none_line_buttonNone␀placeedit|PlaceEditDialogFile Services␀placeedit|hostLabelHost:␀placeedit|liststore1SSH␀placeedit|liststore1WebDAV␀placeedit|liststore1Windows Share␀placeedit|loginLabelUser:␀placeedit|nameLabelLabel:␀placeedit|passwordLabelPassword:␀placeedit|pathLabelRoot:␀placeedit|portLabelPort:␀placeedit|rememberPasswordRemember password␀placeedit|repositoryLabelRepository:␀placeedit|shareLabelShare:␀placeedit|typeLabelType:␀placeedit|webdavsSecure connection␀prin