ion to work properly, %PRODUCTNAME must be restarted.␀restartdialog|reason_extension_installTo apply changes, %PRODUCTNAME must be restarted.␀restartdialog|reason_javaFor the selected Java runtime environment to work properly, %PRODUCTNAME must be restarted.␀restartdialog|reason_language_changeFor the updated UI language setting to take effect, %PRODUCTNAME must be restarted.␀restartdialog|reason_mailmerge_installFor mail merge to work properly, %PRODUCTNAME must be restarted.␀restartdialog|reason_mscompatible_formsmenuFor restructuring the Form menu, %PRODUCTNAME must be restarted.␀restartdialog|reason_openclFor the OpenCL changes to take effect, %PRODUCTNAME must be restarted.␀restartdialog|reason_skiaFor the Skia changes to take effect, %PRODUCTNAME must be restarted.␀restartdialog|reason_threadingFor the multi-threaded calculation changes to take effect, %PRODUCTNAME must be restarted.␀restartdialog|yesRestart Now␀stock_Add␀stock_Apply␀stock_Cancel␀stock_Close␀stock_Delete␀stock_Edit␀stock_Help␀stock_New␀stock_No␀stock_OK␀stock_Remove␀stock_Reset␀stock_Yes␀thineditcontrol|buttonPick Date␀Project-Id-Version: PACKAGE VERSION
