egree, hold down Shift when you click.␀floatingcontour|extended_tip|TBI_POLYDELETERemoves a point from the contour outline. Click here, and then click the point that you want to delete.␀floatingcontour|extended_tip|TBI_POLYEDITLets you change the shape of the contour. Click here, and then drag the handles of the contour.␀floatingcontour|extended_tip|TBI_POLYINSERTInserts a handle that you can drag to change the shape of the contour. Click here, and then click on the contour outline.␀floatingcontour|extended_tip|TBI_POLYMOVELets you drag the handles of the contour to change the shape of the contour.␀floatingcontour|extended_tip|TBI_RECTDraws a rectangular contour where you drag in the object preview. To draw a square, hold down Shift while you drag.␀floatingcontour|extended_tip|TBI_REDOReverses the action of the last Undo command.␀floatingcontour|extended_tip|TBI_SELECTChanges to selection mode, so that you can select the contour.␀floatingcontour|extended_tip|TBI_UNDOReverses the last action.␀floatingcontour|extended_tip|TBI_WORKPLACEDeletes the custom contour. Click here, and then click in the preview area.␀floatingcontour|extended_tip|containerDisplays a preview of the contour.␀floatingcontour|extended_tip|spinbuttonEnter the color tolerance for the Color Replacer as a percentage. To increase the color range that the Color Replacer selects, enter a high percentage.␀floatingcontour|spinbutton|tooltip_textColor Tolerance␀floatingcontour|statuscolorColor␀floatinglineproperty|label1Custom Line Thickness:␀fontworkalignmentcontrol|RID_SVXSTR_ALIGN_CENTER_Center␀fontworkalignmentcontrol|RID_SVXSTR_ALIGN_LEFTAlign _Left␀fontworkalignmentcontrol|RID_SVXSTR_ALIGN_RIGHTAlign _Right␀fontworkalignmentcontrol|RID_SVXSTR_ALIGN_STRETCHS_tretch Justify␀fontworkcharacterspacingcontrol|RID_SVXSTR_CHARS_SPACING_CUSTOM_Custom...␀fontworkcharacterspacingcontrol|RID_SVXSTR_CHARS_SPACING_KERN_PAIRS_Kern Character Pairs␀fontworkcharacterspacingcontrol|RID_SVXSTR_CHARS_S