.␀extended_tip|signaturesThe Certificate Path page of the View Certificate dialog displays the location and the status of the certificate.␀extended_tip|statusThe Certificate Path page of the View Certificate dialog displays the location and the status of the certificate.␀extended_tip|tablecontainerThe Details page of the View Certificate dialog displays detailed information about the certificate.␀extended_tip|valuedetailsUse the value list box to view values and copy them to the clipboard.␀extended_tip|vhighTrusted file locations can be set on the Trusted Sources tab page. Any macro from a trusted file location is allowed to run.␀extended_tip|viewcertOpens the View Certificate dialog for the selected certificate.␀macrosecuritydialog|MacroSecurityDialogMacro Security␀macrosecuritydialog|SecurityLevelPageSecurity Level␀macrosecuritydialog|SecurityTrustPageTrusted Sources␀securitylevelpage|highH_igh.
Only signed macros and macros from trusted file locations are executed.
Unsigned macros are disabled.␀securitylevelpage|low_Low (not recommended).
All macros will be executed without confirmation.
Use this setting only if you are certain that all documents that will be opened are safe.␀securitylevelpage|med_Medium.
Confirmation required before executing macros from untrusted sources.␀securitylevelpage|vhigh_Very high.
Only macros from trusted file locations are allowed to run.
